==English==
===Noun===
'''intrapreneur'''
# a person [[employ]]ed to work [[independently]] within a [[company]] in order to [[introduce]] [[innovation]] and to [[revitalize]] and [[diversify]] its [[business]].  Intrapreneurship is [[Entrepreneurship]] practiced by people within established organizations.  An Intrapreneur acts in ways typical of an [[Entrepreneur]], but as an employee of a preexisting institution, not as an owner, himself.